**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag` (lines 43–50):
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag))
        .collect()
}
```
Iterates over notes, checks if any tag in `n.tags` matches `tag` exactly (via `any`), preserves original order.

